            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "On OpenSSL code",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "> \tdo regtest that just does roundtrip of handful of strings for every supported engine/option combo.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tThen do “KNOWN tests” –a nd comment out the one or (few) that fail for now.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tBe sure one ‘test’ – even if hiden /doccotred before checking – is my HF RC4 one (or do that in HF). Do somnethign that tests this – maybe checkin with diffenr tstring and values? ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\t>>> and make so hasOpenSSL works on windows, and test decrpt from HF for RC4.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
